<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Clear Channel raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clear Channel raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley has raised its rating for Clear Channel Communications Inc to strong buy from outperform, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened up 1-1/4 to 70-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
